~ start

Brian: Just a normal... Wait, Alice? Alice! ALICE!!! Can you hear me??
Alice: Of course not silly, you are inside a mirror?
Alice: How can a mirror talk..
Brian: Alice, listen.. we have to find the other... we have to leave this place...
Alice: I can't go through the mirror silly. You would have to come to me
Brian: What? This is not a mirror... It's just glass. No?
Alice: Come on silly, take my hand, come home from the mirror's land
Alice: Do not worry, the glass won't cut, as long as you keep you eyes shut
Alice: Come from this wall of sand, come into the Wonderland
Alice: There's cards and hearts and chess and tea
Alice: All awaiting you and me
(Alice is not acting like herself. Has something happened to her. I need to find a way to her, quick)
(What should I do)
- Continue talking
	Brian: Alice, stop reciting poetry. This is serious. There is something wrong with this house
	Brian: We need to find the others. Have you seen them
	Alice: Four lost souls the house did save
	Alice: Led by Brian, who faked he's "brave"
	Alice: Alice, who found the rabits den
	Alice: Ever forwards walking Dan
	Alice: Margaret who spin and spins
	Alice: Like in poker, the House always wins
	Brian: Have you seen them? Are they in danger?
	Alice: Danger? Danger! The house's gone bad
	Alice: But you are safe once you go mad
	(she is not making any sence. Did this place do something to her?)
	- Continue talking
		Brian: Alice, focus. This place has done something to you, to us all
		Brian: We need to leave as soon as possible. Is there any way I can reach you, or help you escape
		Alice: Don't bring your friends when you are scared
		Alice: To share your fate just cause they cared
		Alice: Don't beg to safe those who are lost
		Alice: Four lives now your mistakes have cost
		Alice: Every lost and mad is each
		Alice: Split by mirror, not to reach
		Alice: Mimik my movement or I yours
		Alice: Either way I have no doors
		Alice: So try or leave it's all the same
		Alice: You can never outrun the blame
		(What is she saying. Is she blaming me for all this?)
		(I did lead them here.. but I never wanted this to happend...)
		- Continue talking
			Brian: I am sorry... I didn't want this to happen
			Brian: I want to attone. I want to safe you. Even if I have to be scared for days...
			Brian: Just tell me how?
			Alice: Cannot raise what's already dead
			Alice: Nor can you teach reason to those mad
			Alice: Run and fear and feed this place
			Alice: Forever haunted by our face
			Alice: You wan't to save us? No, nevermore
			Alice: All your friends dead, but Elenore
			Brian: [ Heave breathing ] (I need to leave. I cannot save her)
			Brian: (I ... I need to get out)
		- Leave
		do SignalManager.fear.emit(10)
	- Look around for way to reach Alice
	do SignalManager.fear.emit(5)
- Look around for way to reach Alice
do SignalManager.fear.emit(5)

=> END

